  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "l001",
      "section": "preamble",
      "text": "Madhouse Mixtapes, like and subscribe.",
      "cueStart": 0,
      "t": 0,
      "tEnd": 3,
      "confidence": 0.9,
      "flags": []
    },
    {
      "id": "l002",
      "section": "preamble",
      "text": "Whoop whoop, mad love fam.",
      "cueStart": 3,
      "t": 2,
      "tEnd": 7,
      "confidence": 0.9,
      "flags": []
    },
    {
      "id": "l003",
      "section": "preamble",
      "text": "This ain't a diss to musicians, performers, or anybody protecting what they built.",
      "cueStart": 7,
      "t": 6,
      "tEnd": 18,
      "confidence": 0.92,
      "flags": []
    },
    {
      "id": "l004",
      "section": "preamble",
      "text": "I respect that. I push them too.",
      "cueStart": 18,
      "t": 17,
      "tEnd": 23,
      "confidence": 0.8,
      "flags": [
        "uncertain_word"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "l005",
      "section": "preamble",
      "text": "I'm just speaking for me.",
      "cueStart": 23,
      "t": 22,
      "tEnd": 27,
      "confidence": 0.92,
      "flags": []
    },
    {
      "id": "l006",
      "section": "ethic",
      "text": "Open arms. Open doors. Come on in.",
      "cueStart": 27,
      "t": 26,
      "tEnd": 41,
      "confidence": 0.92,
      "flags": []
    },
    {
      "id": "l007",
      "section": "ethic",
      "text": "I'm for the people, by the people. That's the code I keep.",
      "cueStart": 43,
      "t": 42,
      "tEnd": 47,
      "confidence": 0.92,
      "flags": []
    },
    {
      "id": "l008",
      "section": "ethic",
      "text": "Music's just a way I talk when pain is buried deep.",
      "cueStart": 47,
      "t": 46,
      "tEnd": 51,
      "confidence": 0.9,
      "flags": []
    },
    {
      "id": "l009",
      "section": "ethic",
      "text": "I ain't good for marble stages, gold thrones, fake perfume.",
      "cueStart": 51,
      "t": 50,
      "tEnd": 53,
      "confidence": 0.9,
      "flags": []
    },
    {
      "id": "l010",
      "section": "ethic",
      "text": "I was raised with mud sticks heavy in the backroads, always low.",
      "cueStart": 53,
      "t": 52,
      "tEnd": 56,
      "confidence": 0.78,
      "flags": [
        "uncertain_word"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "l011",
      "section": "ethic",
      "text": "My listeners, if you need me, I respond in kind.",
      "cueStart": 56,
      "t": 55,
      "tEnd": 59,
      "confidence": 0.78,
      "flags": [
        "uncertain_word"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "l012",
      "section": "ethic",
      "text": "Community's what I'm building and entertaining by design.",
      "cueStart": 59,
      "t": 58,
      "tEnd": 62,
      "confidence": 0.88,
      "flags": []
    },
    {
      "id": "l013",
      "section": "ethic",
      "text": "People laugh at how I'm thinking — shoot, this fine.",
      "cueStart": 62,
      "t": 61,
      "tEnd": 64,
      "confidence": 0.75,
      "flags": [
        "uncertain_word"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "l014",
      "section": "ethic",
      "text": "I'm still the clown, juggalo about the sticks, wipe the dirt and hold it down.",
      "cueStart": 64,
      "t": 63,
      "tEnd": 67,
      "confidence": 0.86,
      "flags": []
    },
    {
      "id": "l015",
      "section": "kindness",
      "text": "From the sticks and mud I came, from the pressure and the strain.",
      "cueStart": 67,
      "t": 66,
      "tEnd": 71,
      "confidence": 0.9,
      "flags": []
    },
    {
      "id": "l016",
      "section": "kindness",
      "text": "From the folks who got talked over, from the scars that still remain.",
      "cueStart": 71,
      "t": 70,
      "tEnd": 73,
      "confidence": 0.9,
      "flags": []
    },
    {
      "id": "l017",
      "section": "kindness",
      "text": "So if you feel like no one hears you, if your voice got shoved aside.",
      "cueStart": 73,
      "t": 72,
      "tEnd": 77,
      "confidence": 0.9,
      "flags": []
    },
    {
      "id": "l018",
      "section": "kindness",
      "text": "Pull up close, the door is open. You don't have to hurt alone no more.",
      "cueStart": 77,
      "t": 76,
      "tEnd": 80,
      "confidence": 0.9,
      "flags": []
    },
    {
      "id": "l019",
